     * @param {PathGeometryInfo} [opt] 형상 옵션. `buffer`·`minheight`(기본값 0)·`maxheight`(기본값 100)·`centerheight`·`color`·`opacity`·`transparent`·`addstartend`·`edge` 사용 <br>
